WEBVTT

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:35.110
Ken-san, this looks really bad.

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:36.450
What are you talking about?

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:38.410
This is the sacred tree!

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:39.660
Fool!

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:43.240
You think the gods are going
to give us our dinner?

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.370
I know what you mean, but...

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:47.620
Besides, we're really putting
a lot of hard work into this.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.040
The gods might even appreciate that.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.960
The role of a god is to make
us humans happy, right?

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.170
I see. I guess you're right.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:59.090
If you don't have any more objections, then hurry up already.

00:01:59.090 --> 00:01:59.550
Right.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:42.660
Um...

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:46.370
You're kinda in the way.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.040
Don't worry about it.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.120
Mister, this really tastes good!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.750
Doesn't it!

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.080
The secret is using plum vinegar
as a finishing touch.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.170
I see.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.840
Come try this too!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.170
Sure, just wait a moment.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.630
What do you people think you're doing?!

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.930
Looks like the Devil has turned up.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:08.560
You'd better cook the food quickly before she ruins the flavor.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:09.890
Yeah!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:12.890
You people...

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:16.650
Come on! Will you two please
stay out of the way?!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.240
You were thinking I'd spoil
the food, weren't you?!

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.410
I've had enough.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.950
Hey, those guys are Buddhist monks, right?

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:29.870
What are they doing in a Shinto shrine?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:33.790
They've come here to train under the Princess.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.920
This may look like a Shinto shrine at first,

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.960
but it's actually the headquarters for all Buddhist temples and Shinto shrines.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.380
We don't really distinguish between them.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:44.050
As demon exterminators,
the only ones who can match us

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:47.390
are Sasaki's Onmyoudo Bureau in the Shogunate.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:51.810
Because the demons have been
unusually active lately,

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:55.140
an unending stream of people have come here to seek the Princess's help.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:59.900
As a victim, you should recognize your own inexperience and start training yourself.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.190
Do you see the Princess's magnificence now?

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.400
Magnificent, is she?

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:09.780
Didn't your Princess say that she was cursed?

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.790
The Buddha saves, but the gods punish.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.460
If the Buddha can't lift the curse on her,

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:23.460
then perhaps the gods placed it on her.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.560
My grandfather named me Kuchiha.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:42.400
It means "to decay without bearing either flowers or fruits."

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:46.780
He hoped that my bloodline
would end with me.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:50.320
My parents died when I was very young,
and I don't remember their faces.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:54.910
The grandfather who raised me died
when I was ten, and I have no other relatives.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.540
Because my grandfather always kept my markings covered,

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.540
I was immediately showered with insults
when I first went outside.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:04.380
That was the first time I realized just how greatly this blood of mine was feared.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:10.850
By the time I understood that,
there was nobody left around me.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.600
I persuaded myself

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:17.390
that this cursed blood was nothing but a monster born from superstition and delusion.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:22.230
But I really am a monster after all.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.070
If a single drop of this blood can kill,

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:31.160
it's no wonder I'm shunned.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:32.870
But that's...

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:37.620
Toki?

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.170
I'm sorry.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:42.380
If only there was something I could say to her.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.590
I want to say something...

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.500
but I can't.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.810
You idiot.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.900
You're a man, aren't you?
Stop weeping like that.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.400
Is now the time for you
to worry about other people?

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.940
I don't know what you did,

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.740
but if you stopped that dog with your power,

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.910
then this is no time for you to be careless.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.580
What are you, anyway?

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.910
But...

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:20.250
I'm just an average, normal high school student.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.250
There's no way... that sort of power could come from me.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.420
Don't look so pathetic.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.260
No matter what anyone says about you,

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:34.260
you're weak and lame-ass and really pathetic.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.560
You're a normal Toki.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:42.770
After all, Kuchiha, you're so strong and cool, and you're really cute.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.580
It seems spring is in full bloom.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.830
I apologize for my manners.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.670
It pains my heart to interrupt
you two young things.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:09.590
Well, maybe it's my duty as an adult
to hinder Toki right now.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:11.220
Just kidding.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:18.390
I apologize for separating you two lovebirds,

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.560
but I'm going to borrow
Rikugou-san for a little while.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:23.980
The Princess has summoned him.

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.860
This way, please.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.320
I hope the meal is to your liking.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.830
Hey, quit moving.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.330
Is it okay like this?

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.330
Why do we have to get changed anyway?

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.040
No complaints.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.750
It's to purify the area.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:53.340
Your dirty clothes would hinder the ritual.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.720
Ritual?

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:55.760
What?

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.850
Are you going to try some funny stuff again?

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.060
There's a ton of it I'd like to try,

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.930
but you guys can wait until next time.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:05.600
The Princess will perform this ritual.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:10.570
Finally, the Princess's long-awaited resurrection is at hand.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.370
Hail to our Princess!

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:47.600
Hail!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:04.120
You see, long ago the Princess exterminated a snake demon,

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:07.370
but it was a vicious thing,

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:12.380
and it tried to take the Princess to the grave along with it.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.670
Just as if I were shedding
my skin over and over,

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:18.880
I am cursed to shrivel up and
die each and every day.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:21.550
Even though I do not actually die,

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:25.220
without switching bodies like this,
my soul cannot survive.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.390
Switching bodies?

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.770
Then should I demonstrate
the real thing to you?

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:37.360
This rite requires two bodies and a soul.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:41.780
This humanoid shape and that withered lump are the bodies.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.510
This is the shape of the Princess's soul,

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.640
the shape of her heart and spirit.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:05.140
Normally, the body and the soul
cannot be separated,

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:08.640
because without a body,
the spirit cannot survive.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:14.690
But occasionally, there are people who can transfer their souls to different bodies.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:19.110
There are currently four
who possess this special skill.

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:23.200
One is Teiten, the god who made this world.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.620
God, huh.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:28.120
Another is Bonten. It seems
you have already met him.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.370
Another is Kokuten. As of now,
his identity is said to be unknown.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:36.840
And the name and fate of Gyouten have been granted to the Princess.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.550
What do you mean, granted to her?

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:45.890
Teiten grants a human his life.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:51.520
That is a thing called "destiny,"
which is inscribed delicately on the soul.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:57.270
If Teiten grants people life,
and those people control the world,

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:02.280
it is as if all creation is
in the palm of Teiten's hand.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:11.460
But things like that are boring, aren't they?

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.010
Help me.

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:22.840
Please help me.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.260
What do you want?

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.220
What happened?

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:30.430
A guest. How many has that been today?

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.730
Humans are chipping away at the bark.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:37.360
They have no pity for the one
who waits for death.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.520
Please, help.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:39.980
What is that thing?

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:44.410
Isn't that the sacred tree?

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.740
Hey, wait! I need more details!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:47.990
Hey! Damn!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:54.500
If a spirit is that weak, then it's not safe
to separate it from its body.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.250
Where are you going?!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.250
You should know that already.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.090
Aren't you going to wait
for Bonten's instructions?

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:03.090
I have no intention of being his servant.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:06.140
You think I should take my sweet time like him?

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:08.970
Nothing good will come of just waiting.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.350
We'll be killed off one by one.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:15.100
Who will protect them if we don't make a move?!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.520
However much you might struggle against it,

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:22.860
if it is written in heaven's net,
then it cannot be changed.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:25.700
Heaven's net is the blueprint for existence.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.070
The net depicts the destiny of this world.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.370
The Four Gods alone can decipher heaven's net.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:36.080
But the only one who can spin heaven's net anew is Teiten himself, and one other.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:38.380
The Blank Page.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:42.380
Rikugou-dono, this world knows nothing of you.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:46.550
And so Teiten has not given you a destiny.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:50.140
You alone in this world have
no predestined future.

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:54.140
You are like a white page
that has yet to be written on.

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:58.100
You are the sole existence that holds infinite possibilities in your future.

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:05.150
Hence, Blank Page, you hold a power on par with the gods of this world.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:11.330
Maybe I told you this too suddenly.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.950
I greet you again. I am Ginshu.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.870
I am pleased to meet you both, gentlemen.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.710
Should I explain it to you again?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:23.090
Well, rather than that...

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.420
You're a man?

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.470
That's what I'm more curious about.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:31.220
Were you even listening to what the Princess was saying?!

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.850
It's all right, Tsuruume.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.230
That's easy to understand.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:37.890
Here.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.730
I saw it.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.230
I didn't see anything.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.570
If a woman takes the job,
then she dresses as a man,

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:46.650
and if a man does, then he dresses as a woman.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.530
That's the custom.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.240
As for me, I'm not really one or the other.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:59.040
For a long time, priestesses have been treated as asexual, as they are tools of the gods.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:03.210
But that is all the more convenient and straightforward for me.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.880
Which did you start off as?

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.670
I will leave that to your imagination.

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:14.180
Apparently the preparations for the meal are done,
so let us continue after we have eaten.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.390
Right! Let's go!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:22.230
It's a feast!

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.270
It's irresistible.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:27.990
From this side, we have tofu with miso paste, fish cake tofu,

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.490
spinach with mashed tofu and common tofu,

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.700
spiral tofu, and tofu congee.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.160
This is iced tofu, glazed with brown sugar syrup.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.830
It's a tofu-themed banquet.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:47.000
There's no meat.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:52.220
Man, I'm stuffed.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.430
Rikugou-dono...

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:00.430
Did you understand what I told you earlier?

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:04.940
Now I have a rather selfish
request to make of you.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.480
Please hear me out.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:13.410
Would you lend us your future possibilities and your power?

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.820
Heaven's net is absolute,

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:20.580
and those who do not abide by it meet harsh fates and wish they could be saved.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.620
Rikugou-dono, they need your help.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.130
Um...

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:29.760
It seems that I have moved too quickly.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:33.300
Let us save the rest of this
conversation for another day.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.050
It is late in the day,

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.510
so rooms will be prepared for you.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:39.470
Please spend the night here.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:43.020
You are safe within the temple building,
so please rest easy.

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.980
Shinshu will be pleased too.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.370
Be quiet!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:06.120
Didn't I tell you that once I'm asleep, I'd pull out every one of your feathers if you woke me up?

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:13.050
Still, Bon, this is no time to talk like that.

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:15.970
Tsuyukusa has gone off on his own.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.680
So what?

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:18.550
I'm going back to sleep.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.140
This is not a situation to sleep through!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.810
I'm worried about him being out on his own.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.640
We should at least go and see how he is.

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.690
Situation?

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.440
What situation?

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.150
I create the situations around here.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.900
Napoleon said that too.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:39.160
Napoleon said some pretty good stuff.

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:43.160
Bon, why aren't you going
to bring the Hakutaku here?

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.670
Me? That's a bold statement, Utsubushi.

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:50.540
You want me to bring him here by force, as the Princess did?

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.710
And what of his own free will?

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:57.180
In the first place, his power isn't something that can be obtained by asking for it.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.640
The Princess is struggling
desperately but in vain.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:04.520
I suppose we both want to
make use of the White One.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.230
That's not the Princess's place.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.190
So what are we to do?

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.190
Don't worry.

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:14.610
In his state of ignorance,
he's powerless, but he's no fool.

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.190
We merely have to wait.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.490
How valiant.

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:21.910
Where do you get that confidence from?

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:25.500
If I can't believe in myself,
then what <i>can</i> I believe in?

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.250
According to what I've learned,

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.210
he will become my ultimate weapon and protector in Amatsuki.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:34.380
But if I can't steal my weapon to use
in accordance with my plans,

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.550
then it will result in ruin,

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:39.220
and I may be caught like a bird in a net.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:42.850
However, I'm confident that I <i>can</i> use him.

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:45.020
Now, all that's left to do
is to polish my weapon.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:46.730
Come now, Utsubushi.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:00.320
Those who would oppose me
are most unfortunate.

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:02.950
The fools who would touch my possessions

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.450
will be condemned by my own hands.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:09.330
Oh?

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:12.290
So Kon and the others
won't return tonight?

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.460
I'm sorry to say so.

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.340
Did you have plans with him?

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:18.630
Well, it's not exactly like that.

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.970
They left early this morning,

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:24.600
but I fear that if they
aren't back by this late...

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:30.060
I hope they aren't mixed up in anything funny.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.060
Where did they go, anyway?

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.730
U-Um, well,

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:40.490
th-there was a bit of a problem,
and he had to return to his hometown.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:43.320
Wh-What I mean to say is...

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.910
they went to learn the method,

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:50.080
no, the route to return to their hometown.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.460
What?!

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:55.460
I knew they were from the same village,

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:56.590
but are they going home?

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:59.590
Well, that's a possibility.

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:03.590
High priest, please come quickly.

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:06.970
It's about Nakamura-ya Kenpachi.
I spoke to you about him yesterday.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.140
Please help him.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.350
Nakamura-ya-san?

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:11.940
Another incident?

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.060
What happened this time?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.900
The victim was horribly burned.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.070
In any case, please hurry.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.780
I beg you.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.570
I understand, Nakamura-ya-san.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.320
I'll go there now.

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.450
Heihachi-kun, I apologize for the circumstances,

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.410
but could you return in the morning?

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.330
Yes, I understand.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.120
Well, take care.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:43.050
Hey, Kon, where do you come from?

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.220
Hm?

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.260
From <i>far</i> away.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.220
Is he going home?

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:53.770
I don't care!

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:56.270
It's not as though I'll miss him!

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:04.030
Man, that hurt.

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:07.950
For such a shabby-looking temple,
it sure has a strong barrier around it.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.330
It caught me off guard.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:10.990
Damn!

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:12.290
I lost sight of him.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:15.120
That bastard! Where is he?

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:20.000
What's this?

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:25.550
Wait for me, master!

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:35.600
This is terrible.

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:37.150
What happened?

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.690
Sir...

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:46.400
Are the demons causing
mischief for people again?
